    "你在 iPhone 或 CarPlay 播放的视频将在此自动同步记录播放进度。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "你在 iPhone 或 CarPlay 播放的视频将在此自动同步记录播放进度。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "您在 iPhone 或 CarPlay 播放的影片會自動同步播放進度並顯示於此。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Videos played on iPhone or CarPlay appear here automatically with synced progress."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les vidéos lues sur iPhone ou CarPlay apparaissent ici avec leur progression synchronisée."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Auf iPhone oder CarPlay abgespielte Videos erscheinen hier automatisch mit synchronisiertem Fortschritt."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los videos reproducidos en iPhone o CarPlay aparecerán aquí con el progreso sincronizado."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vídeos reproduzidos no iPhone ou CarPlay aparecem aqui com o progresso sincronizado."}}}},
