    "飞牛私有云 (fnOS) 推荐使用内置 WebDAV 协议进行高速挂载与流媒体直链播放。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "飞牛私有云 (fnOS) 推荐使用内置 WebDAV 协议进行高速挂载与流媒体直链播放。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "飛牛私有雲 (fnOS) 建議使用內建 WebDAV 協定快速掛載並播放串流直連。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "For fnOS, use the built-in WebDAV protocol for fast mounting and direct streaming."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pour fnOS, utilisez le protocole WebDAV intégré pour un montage rapide et la lecture directe en continu."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Für fnOS empfiehlt sich das integrierte WebDAV-Protokoll für schnelles Einbinden und direktes Streaming."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En fnOS, usa el protocolo WebDAV integrado para montar rápidamente y reproducir mediante transmisión directa."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No fnOS, use o protocolo WebDAV integrado para montagem rápida e transmissão direta."}}}},
