    "第二字幕 (次字幕)": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "第二字幕 (次字幕)"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "第二字幕 (次字幕)"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Secondary Subtitle"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sous-titre secondaire"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Zweiter Untertitel"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Subtítulo secundario"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Legenda secundária"}}}},
    "等待连接 CarPlay": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "等待连接 CarPlay"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "等待連接 CarPlay"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Waiting for CarPlay"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En attente de CarPlay"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Warten auf CarPlay"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esperando a CarPlay"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aguardando o CarPlay"}}}},
    "人声增强运用动态规格化压缩（dynaudnorm），提升低语对白响度并平衡爆炸声。超量增益最高可将音量放大至 200%。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "人声增强运用动态规格化压缩（dynaudnorm），提升低语对白响度并平衡爆炸声。超量增益最高可将音量放大至 200%。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "人聲增強使用動態正規化壓縮（dynaudnorm），提高低聲對白音量並平衡爆炸聲。增益最高可將音量提高至 200%。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Voice boost uses dynamic normalization (dynaudnorm) to raise quiet dialogue and balance loud effects. Extra gain can increase volume by up to 200%."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "L’amplification vocale utilise la normalisation dynamique (dynaudnorm) pour renforcer les dialogues faibles et équilibrer les effets forts. Le gain supplémentaire peut augmenter le volume jusqu’à 200 %."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Die Sprachverstärkung nutzt dynamische Normalisierung (dynaudnorm), um leise Dialoge anzuheben und laute Effekte auszugleichen. Die Zusatzverstärkung erhöht die Lautstärke um bis zu 200 %."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La mejora de voz usa normalización dinámica (dynaudnorm) para realzar diálogos bajos y equilibrar efectos fuertes. La ganancia adicional puede aumentar el volumen hasta un 200 %."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "O reforço de voz usa normalização dinâmica (dynaudnorm) para realçar diálogos baixos e equilibrar efeitos altos. O ganho extra pode aumentar o volume em até 200%."}}}},
    "如果字幕出现过早，请点按增加延迟（+）；若字幕出现过迟，请减少延迟（-）。支持 AVPlayer 与 MPV 双引擎无缝校准。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "如果字幕出现过早，请点按增加延迟（+）；若字幕出现过迟，请减少延迟（-）。支持 AVPlayer 与 MPV 双引擎无缝校准。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "若字幕過早出現，請點選增加延遲（+）；若過遲，請減少延遲（-）。支援 AVPlayer 與 MPV 雙引擎同步校準。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If subtitles appear too early, increase the delay (+); if they appear too late, decrease it (−). Works with both AVPlayer and MPV."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Si les sous-titres apparaissent trop tôt, augmentez le délai (+) ; s’ils arrivent trop tard, réduisez-le (−). Compatible avec AVPlayer et MPV."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Erscheinen Untertitel zu früh, erhöhe die Verzögerung (+); kommen sie zu spät, verringere sie (−). Funktioniert mit AVPlayer und MPV."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Si los subtítulos aparecen demasiado pronto, aumenta el retraso (+); si aparecen tarde, redúcelo (−). Compatible con AVPlayer y MPV."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se as legendas aparecerem cedo demais, aumente o atraso (+); se aparecerem tarde, diminua-o (−). Compatível com AVPlayer e MPV."}}}},
    "适当上移字幕可避免与内嵌压制字幕或底部弹幕重叠。双字幕允许您同时展示两种语言轨道。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "适当上移字幕可避免与内嵌压制字幕或底部弹幕重叠。双字幕允许您同时展示两种语言轨道。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "適度上移字幕可避免與內嵌字幕或底部彈幕重疊。雙字幕可同時顯示兩種語言軌道。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Raise subtitles to avoid overlapping embedded subtitles or bottom comments. Dual subtitles show two language tracks at once."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Remontez les sous-titres pour éviter les chevauchements avec les sous-titres intégrés ou les commentaires. Le double affichage montre deux pistes."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verschiebe Untertitel nach oben, damit sie eingeblendete Untertitel oder Kommentare nicht überdecken. Zwei Untertitelspuren lassen sich gleichzeitig anzeigen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sube los subtítulos para evitar que se solapen con subtítulos incrustados o comentarios. La opción doble muestra dos pistas a la vez."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Suba as legendas para evitar sobreposição com legendas embutidas ou comentários. O modo duplo exibe duas faixas ao mesmo tempo."}}}},
    "限速用于 HLS 自适应码率选择；缓存上限对 MPV 直接生效，AVPlayer 按等效预读时长请求。设置会保存，并在下一次播放时使用。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "限速用于 HLS 自适应码率选择；缓存上限对 MPV 直接生效，AVPlayer 按等效预读时长请求。设置会保存，并在下一次播放时使用。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "速度上限用於 HLS 自適應位元率選擇；緩衝上限直接套用於 MPV，AVPlayer 則以等效預讀時間請求。設定會儲存並於下次播放時套用。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The speed limit guides HLS adaptive bitrate selection. The cache limit applies directly to MPV; AVPlayer uses an equivalent prefetch duration. Changes are saved for the next playback."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La limite de débit guide le choix adaptatif HLS. La limite de cache s’applique directement à MPV ; AVPlayer utilise une durée de préchargement équivalente. Les réglages seront appliqués à la prochaine lecture."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Das Tempolimit steuert die adaptive HLS-Bitratenwahl. Das Cache-Limit gilt direkt für MPV; AVPlayer verwendet eine entsprechende Vorabrufdauer. Änderungen gelten bei der nächsten Wiedergabe."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El límite de velocidad guía la selección de tasa adaptativa HLS. El límite de caché se aplica directamente a MPV; AVPlayer usa una duración de precarga equivalente. Se guardará para la próxima reproducción."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "O limite de velocidade orienta a taxa adaptativa HLS. O limite de cache vale diretamente para o MPV; o AVPlayer usa uma duração equivalente de pré-carregamento. As alterações serão usadas na próxima reprodução."}}}},
    "仅显示播放诊断": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "仅显示播放诊断"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "僅顯示播放診斷"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show Playback Diagnostics Only"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Afficher uniquement le diagnostic de lecture"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nur Wiedergabediagnose anzeigen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mostrar solo diagnósticos de reproducción"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mostrar apenas diagnósticos de reprodução"}}}},
    "从本地视频列表、相册选择，或从支持的视频 App 投屏。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "从本地视频列表、相册选择，或从支持的视频 App 投屏。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "從本機影片列表或相簿選取，也可從支援的影片 App 投放。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choose from local videos or your library, or cast from a supported video app."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choisissez une vidéo locale ou de votre photothèque, ou diffusez depuis une app compatible."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wähle ein lokales Video oder eines aus deiner Mediathek, oder übertrage es aus einer unterstützten App."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Elige un video local o de tu fototeca, o envíalo desde una app compatible."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Escolha um vídeo local ou da biblioteca, ou transmita de um app compatível."}}}},
    "添加个人媒体源": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "添加个人媒体源"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "新增個人媒體來源"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Add Personal Media Source"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ajouter une source multimédia personnelle"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Persönliche Medienquelle hinzufügen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Añadir fuente multimedia personal"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Adicionar fonte de mídia pessoal"}}}},
    "SMB 共享": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SMB 共享"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SMB 共用"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SMB Share"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Partage SMB"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SMB-Freigabe"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Recurso compartido SMB"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Compartilhamento SMB"}}}},
    "局域网共享 (SMB)": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "局域网共享 (SMB)"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "區域網路共用 (SMB)"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Local Network Share (SMB)"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Partage réseau local (SMB)"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lokale Netzwerkfreigabe (SMB)"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Recurso compartido local (SMB)"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Compartilhamento na rede local (SMB)"}}}},
    "Wi-Fi 上传": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wi-Fi 上传"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wi-Fi 上傳"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wi-Fi Upload"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Importation Wi-Fi"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WLAN-Upload"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Carga por Wi-Fi"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Envio por Wi-Fi"}}}},
    "视频 App 投屏": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "视频 App 投屏"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "影片 App 投放"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cast from Video App"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diffuser depuis une app vidéo"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aus Video-App übertragen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enviar desde una app de video"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Transmitir de um app de vídeo"}}}},
    "视频仅显示在车机屏幕，手机作为遥控器使用": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "视频仅显示在车机屏幕，手机作为遥控器使用"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "影片僅顯示於車載螢幕，手機可作為遙控器使用"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Video appears only on the car display; use your phone as the remote."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La vidéo s’affiche uniquement sur l’écran de la voiture ; utilisez le téléphone comme télécommande."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Das Video wird nur auf dem Fahrzeugdisplay angezeigt; das iPhone dient als Fernbedienung."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El video solo aparece en la pantalla del coche; usa el teléfono como control remoto."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "O vídeo aparece apenas na tela do carro; use o celular como controle remoto."}}}},
    "敬请期待Mivu Pro": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "敬请期待Mivu Pro"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "敬請期待 Mivu Pro"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro coming soon"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro arrive bientôt"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro kommt bald"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro llegará pronto"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro em breve"}}}},
    "服务器名称 (如: \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "服务器名称 (如: \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "伺服器名稱 (例如：\\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Server Name (e.g. \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nom du serveur (ex. : \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Servername (z. B. \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nombre del servidor (p. ej., \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nome do servidor (ex.: \\(selectedService.defaultServerName))"}}}},
    "密码 / 访问令牌": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "密码 / 访问令牌"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "密碼 / 存取權杖"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Password / Access Token"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mot de passe / jeton d’accès"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Passwort / Zugriffstoken"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Contraseña / token de acceso"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senha / token de acesso"}}}},
    "需要连接个人私有云或家庭影院？Mivu Pro 支持 Emby、Jellyfin、SMB、WebDAV 媒体库挂载，提供影院级海报墙与元数据刮削。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "需要连接个人私有云或家庭影院？Mivu Pro 支持 Emby、Jellyfin、SMB、WebDAV 媒体库挂载，提供影院级海报墙与元数据刮削。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "想連接個人私有雲或家庭劇院？Mivu Pro 支援掛載 Emby、Jellyfin、SMB、WebDAV 媒體庫，並提供電影海報牆與中繼資料刮削。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect a personal cloud or home theater. Mivu Pro supports Emby, Jellyfin, SMB, and WebDAV libraries, with poster walls and metadata matching."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connectez votre cloud personnel ou home cinéma. Mivu Pro prend en charge Emby, Jellyfin, SMB et WebDAV, avec affiches et métadonnées."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verbinde deine private Cloud oder dein Heimkino. Mivu Pro unterstützt Emby, Jellyfin, SMB und WebDAV mit Postern und Metadaten."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecta tu nube personal o cine en casa. Mivu Pro admite bibliotecas Emby, Jellyfin, SMB y WebDAV, con carteles y metadatos."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecte sua nuvem pessoal ou home theater. O Mivu Pro aceita bibliotecas Emby, Jellyfin, SMB e WebDAV, com capas e metadados."}}}},
    "支持连接 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 局域网共享及飞牛私有云，畅享高清视频串流。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "支持连接 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 局域网共享及飞牛私有云，畅享高清视频串流。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "支援連接 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 區域網路共用與飛牛私有雲，串流播放高畫質影片。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, SMB shares, and fnOS for high-quality video streaming."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connectez Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, des partages SMB et fnOS pour diffuser des vidéos en haute qualité."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verbinde Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, SMB-Freigaben und fnOS für hochwertiges Videostreaming."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecta Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, recursos SMB y fnOS para reproducir videos en alta calidad."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecte Emby, Jellyfin, compartilhamentos SMB e fnOS para transmitir vídeos em alta qualidade."}}}},
    "关于 Mivu": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "关于 Mivu"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "關於 Mivu"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "About Mivu"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "À propos de Mivu"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Über Mivu"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Acerca de Mivu"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sobre o Mivu"}}}},
    "关于 Mivu Pro": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "关于 Mivu Pro"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "關於 Mivu Pro"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "About Mivu Pro"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "À propos de Mivu Pro"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Über Mivu Pro"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Acerca de Mivu Pro"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sobre o Mivu Pro"}}}},
    "检测行驶中视频限制": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "检测行驶中视频限制"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "偵測行車影片限制"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Check Driving Video Restrictions"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vérifier les restrictions vidéo en conduite"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Videobeschränkungen während der Fahrt prüfen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Comprobar restricciones de video al conducir"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verificar restrições de vídeo durante a condução"}}}},
    "系统诊断中心": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "系统诊断中心"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "系統診斷中心"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "System Diagnostics"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnostic système"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Systemdiagnose"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnóstico del sistema"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnóstico do sistema"}}}},
    "网络链路与投屏深度诊断": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "网络链路与投屏深度诊断"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "網路連線與投放深度診斷"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Network & Casting Diagnostics"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnostic réseau et diffusion"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Netzwerk- & Übertragungsdiagnose"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnóstico de red y transmisión"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diagnóstico de rede e transmissão"}}}},
