    "上传完成后，视频会出现在本地视频列表中。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "上传完成后，视频会出现在本地视频列表中。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "上傳完成後，影片會出現在本機影片列表中。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Uploaded videos appear in the local video list."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les vidéos importées apparaissent dans la liste des vidéos locales."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hochgeladene Videos erscheinen in der lokalen Videoliste."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los videos subidos aparecen en la lista de videos locales."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Os vídeos enviados aparecem na lista de vídeos locais."}}}},
    "请让上传设备与此 iPhone 连接同一个 Wi-Fi；App 保持在前台时可接收上传。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请让上传设备与此 iPhone 连接同一个 Wi-Fi；App 保持在前台时可接收上传。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "請讓上傳裝置與此 iPhone 連接至同一個 Wi-Fi；App 保持在前景時才能接收上傳。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect the uploading device to the same Wi-Fi network as this iPhone. Keep the app open to receive uploads."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connectez l’appareil d’envoi au même réseau Wi-Fi que cet iPhone. Gardez l’app ouverte pour recevoir les fichiers."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verbinde das sendende Gerät mit demselben WLAN wie dieses iPhone. Lass die App geöffnet, um Uploads zu empfangen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecta el dispositivo de carga a la misma red Wi-Fi que este iPhone. Mantén la app abierta para recibir archivos."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecte o dispositivo de envio à mesma rede Wi-Fi deste iPhone. Mantenha o app aberto para receber arquivos."}}}},
    "通过 Wi-Fi 上传的视频会出现在这里。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过 Wi-Fi 上传的视频会出现在这里。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "透過 Wi-Fi 上傳的影片會顯示在這裡。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Videos uploaded over Wi-Fi will appear here."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les vidéos importées par Wi-Fi apparaîtront ici."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Über WLAN hochgeladene Videos erscheinen hier."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los videos subidos por Wi-Fi aparecerán aquí."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Os vídeos enviados por Wi-Fi aparecerão aqui."}}}},
    "刷新本地视频": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "刷新本地视频"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "重新整理本機影片"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Refresh Local Videos"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Actualiser les vidéos locales"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lokale Videos aktualisieren"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Actualizar videos locales"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Atualizar vídeos locais"}}}},
    "投送服务已就绪": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "投送服务已就绪"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "投放服務已就緒"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Casting Service Ready"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Service de diffusion prêt"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Übertragungsdienst bereit"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Servicio de transmisión listo"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Serviço de transmissão pronto"}}}},
    "投屏监控端点、测试基准源、URL 播放器与诊断日志": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "投屏监控端点、测试基准源、URL 播放器与诊断日志"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "投放監控端點、測試來源、URL 播放器與診斷記錄"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Casting monitor, test streams, URL player, and diagnostic logs"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Moniteur de diffusion, flux de test, lecteur URL et journaux de diagnostic"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Überwachungsmonitor, Teststreams, URL-Player und Diagnoseprotokolle"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Monitor de transmisión, flujos de prueba, reproductor URL y registros de diagnóstico"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Monitor de transmissão, streams de teste, player de URL e registros de diagnóstico"}}}},
    "包含 DLNA 服务监控、Apple HLS / MP4 测试流、自定义 URL 播放器及系统网络诊断。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "包含 DLNA 服务监控、Apple HLS / MP4 测试流、自定义 URL 播放器及系统网络诊断。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "包含 DLNA 服務監控、Apple HLS / MP4 測試串流、自訂 URL 播放器與系統網路診斷。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Includes DLNA service monitoring, Apple HLS/MP4 test streams, a custom URL player, and system network diagnostics."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Comprend la surveillance DLNA, des flux de test Apple HLS/MP4, un lecteur URL personnalisé et le diagnostic réseau."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enthält DLNA-Überwachung, Apple-HLS/MP4-Teststreams, einen eigenen URL-Player und Netzwerkdiagnosen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Incluye supervisión DLNA, flujos de prueba Apple HLS/MP4, un reproductor URL y diagnósticos de red."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inclui monitoramento DLNA, streams de teste Apple HLS/MP4, player de URL e diagnóstico de rede."}}}},
    "包含 Apple 官方 HLS 多码率流、MP4 高清测试视频，用于验证播放引擎渲染与 CarPlay 投送稳定性。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "包含 Apple 官方 HLS 多码率流、MP4 高清测试视频，用于验证播放引擎渲染与 CarPlay 投送稳定性。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "包含 Apple 官方 HLS 多位元率串流與 MP4 高畫質測試影片，用來驗證播放引擎與 CarPlay 投放穩定性。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Includes Apple's official HLS multibitrate stream and an HD MP4 test video to check playback rendering and CarPlay casting stability."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inclut le flux HLS multidébit officiel d’Apple et une vidéo MP4 HD pour vérifier le rendu et la stabilité de CarPlay."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enthält Apples offiziellen HLS-Teststream mit mehreren Bitraten und ein HD-MP4-Testvideo zur Prüfung von Wiedergabe und CarPlay-Stabilität."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Incluye el flujo HLS multibitrável oficial de Apple y un video MP4 HD para comprobar la reproducción y la estabilidad de CarPlay."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inclui o fluxo HLS multibitrate oficial da Apple e um vídeo MP4 HD para verificar a reprodução e a estabilidade do CarPlay."}}}},
    "升级到 Mivu Pro": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "升级到 Mivu Pro"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "升級至 Mivu Pro"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Upgrade to Mivu Pro"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Passer à Mivu Pro"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Auf Mivu Pro upgraden"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pasar a Mivu Pro"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fazer upgrade para o Mivu Pro"}}}},
    "Mivu Pro 全能媒体中心": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro 全能媒体中心"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro 全方位媒體中心"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro: Your All-in-One Media Center"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro : votre centre multimédia tout-en-un"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro: Dein vielseitiges Mediencenter"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro: tu centro multimedia todo en uno"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mivu Pro: sua central de mídia completa"}}}},
    "支持 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 私有媒体库挂载，精美影视海报墙与智能刮削。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "支持 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 私有媒体库挂载，精美影视海报墙与智能刮削。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "支援掛載 Emby、Jellyfin、WebDAV、SMB 個人媒體庫，並提供海報牆與智慧中繼資料刮削。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV, or SMB libraries, with rich poster walls and automatic metadata matching."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connectez vos bibliothèques Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV ou SMB, avec affiches et récupération automatique des métadonnées."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Verbinde Emby-, Jellyfin-, WebDAV- oder SMB-Bibliotheken mit Posteransichten und automatischem Metadatenabgleich."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecta bibliotecas Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV o SMB con carteles y búsqueda automática de metadatos."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conecte bibliotecas Emby, Jellyfin, WebDAV ou SMB com capas e busca automática de metadados."}}}},
    "选择投屏内容": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "选择投屏内容"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "選擇投放內容"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choose What to Cast"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choisir le contenu à diffuser"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inhalt für Übertragung auswählen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Elegir qué transmitir"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Escolher o que transmitir"}}}},
