    "关闭行驶中视频限制检测？": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "关闭行驶中视频限制检测？"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "要關閉行車影片限制偵測嗎？"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Disable the driving video restriction check?"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Désactiver la vérification des restrictions vidéo en conduite ?"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prüfung der Videobeschränkung während der Fahrt deaktivieren?"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Desactivar la comprobación de restricciones de video al conducir?"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Desativar a verificação de restrição de vídeo durante a condução?"}}}},
    "继续检测": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "继续检测"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "繼續偵測"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Keep Check Enabled"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Garder la vérification activée"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Prüfung aktiviert lassen"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mantener la comprobación activada"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Manter a verificação ativada"}}}},
    "仅用于测试": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "仅用于测试"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "僅供測試"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Testing Only"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pour les tests uniquement"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nur für Tests"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Solo para pruebas"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Somente para testes"}}}},
    "此开关仅存在于 Debug 构建，用于验证应用的降级路径。车机系统仍可能拒绝视频播放。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此开关仅存在于 Debug 构建，用于验证应用的降级路径。车机系统仍可能拒绝视频播放。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此選項僅存在於 Debug 版本，用來驗證 App 的降級路徑。車機系統仍可能拒絕播放影片。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This option is available only in Debug builds to test the app's fallback path. The car system may still reject video playback."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cette option est réservée aux versions Debug pour tester le mode de secours de l’app. Le système du véhicule peut toujours refuser la lecture vidéo."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diese Option ist nur in Debug-Builds verfügbar, um den Ausweichpfad der App zu testen. Das Fahrzeugsystem kann die Videowiedergabe weiterhin ablehnen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta opción solo está disponible en compilaciones Debug para probar la ruta alternativa de la app. El sistema del coche aún puede rechazar la reproducción de video."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta opção existe apenas em builds Debug para testar a rota alternativa do app. O sistema do carro ainda pode rejeitar a reprodução de vídeo."}}}},
    "设置回退秒数以便暂停恢复时温习前情；开启片头片尾智能跳过，将在连播时更省心；人声增强可动态平衡对白响度。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "设置回退秒数以便暂停恢复时温习前情；开启片头片尾智能跳过，将在连播时更省心；人声增强可动态平衡对白响度。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "設定倒退秒數，方便暫停後接續觀看；開啟片頭片尾智慧略過，連續播放更省心；人聲增強可動態平衡對白音量。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Set how far to rewind when resuming. Smart intro and credits skipping makes binge-watching easier, while Voice Boost balances dialogue volume."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choisissez le recul à la reprise. Le saut intelligent des génériques facilite les lectures en continu, et l’amplification des voix équilibre les dialogues."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lege fest, wie weit beim Fortsetzen zurückgesprungen wird. Intelligentes Überspringen von Vor- und Abspann erleichtert Serienmarathons; die Sprachverstärkung gleicht Dialoge aus."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Elige cuánto retroceder al reanudar. La omisión inteligente de intros y créditos facilita las sesiones seguidas, y el realce de voz equilibra los diálogos."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Defina quanto voltar ao retomar. Pular aberturas e créditos automaticamente facilita maratonas, e o realce de voz equilibra os diálogos."}}}},
    "开启后，在手机竖屏播放视频时会自动微调字幕比例，避免在小窗口下遮挡画面；在播放器中点击字幕按钮也可实时微调。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "开启后，在手机竖屏播放视频时会自动微调字幕比例，避免在小窗口下遮挡画面；在播放器中点击字幕按钮也可实时微调。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "開啟後，在手機直向播放影片時會自動微調字幕比例，避免遮擋小視窗畫面；也可在播放器中點選字幕按鈕即時調整。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "When enabled, subtitles are scaled down slightly during portrait playback to keep them from obscuring the smaller video. You can also adjust them from the subtitle button in the player."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lorsque cette option est activée, les sous-titres sont légèrement réduits en mode portrait pour ne pas masquer la vidéo. Vous pouvez aussi les régler depuis le lecteur."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bei aktivierter Option werden Untertitel im Hochformat leicht verkleinert, damit sie das kleinere Bild nicht verdecken. Du kannst sie auch im Player anpassen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Al activarlo, los subtítulos se reducen ligeramente en vertical para no tapar el video. También puedes ajustarlos desde el botón de subtítulos del reproductor."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Quando ativado, as legendas diminuem um pouco na orientação vertical para não cobrir o vídeo. Você também pode ajustá-las pelo botão de legendas no player."}}}},
    "DLNA / UPnP Receiver": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "DLNA / UPnP 接收端"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "DLNA / UPnP 接收端"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "DLNA / UPnP Receiver"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Récepteur DLNA / UPnP"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "DLNA- / UPnP-Empfänger"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Receptor DLNA / UPnP"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Receptor DLNA / UPnP"}}}},
