    "媒体解码失败，已尝试转码仍无法播放": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "媒体解码失败，已尝试转码仍无法播放"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "媒體解碼失敗，已嘗試轉碼仍無法播放"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Unable to play this media, even after trying a transcoded stream."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lecture impossible, même après avoir essayé un flux transcodé."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wiedergabe auch nach Versuch mit einem transkodierten Stream nicht möglich."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo reproducir este contenido, ni siquiera con un flujo transcodificado."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Não foi possível reproduzir esta mídia, mesmo após tentar um stream transcodificado."}}}},
