    "服务器名称（例如 %@）": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "服务器名称（例如 %@）"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "伺服器名稱（例如 %@）"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Server Name (e.g. %@)"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nom du serveur (ex. : %@)"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Servername (z. B. %@)"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nombre del servidor (p. ej., %@)"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nome do servidor (ex.: %@)"}}}},
    "Colin Levy 是美国独立电影导演与视觉特效艺术家，曾就职于皮克斯动画工作室（Pixar Animation Studios），参与制作了多部知名皮克斯长片。作为 Blender 基金会 Durian 开放电影项目核心导演，他执导了享誉全球的开源奇幻动画短片《Sintel》。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy 是美国独立电影导演与视觉特效艺术家，曾就职于皮克斯动画工作室（Pixar Animation Studios），参与制作了多部知名皮克斯长片。作为 Blender 基金会 Durian 开放电影项目核心导演，他执导了享誉全球的开源奇幻动画短片《Sintel》。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy 是美國獨立電影導演與視覺特效藝術家，曾任職於皮克斯動畫工作室，參與多部知名皮克斯長片製作。他曾執導 Blender 基金會 Durian 開放電影《Sintel》。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy is an American independent filmmaker and visual effects artist. He worked at Pixar and directed Sintel, Blender Foundation’s open fantasy short film."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy est un cinéaste indépendant américain et artiste des effets visuels. Ancien de Pixar, il a réalisé Sintel, le court métrage fantastique libre de la Blender Foundation."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy ist ein US-amerikanischer Independent-Filmemacher und VFX-Künstler. Er arbeitete bei Pixar und führte Regie bei Sintel, dem freien Fantasy-Kurzfilm der Blender Foundation."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy es un cineasta independiente estadounidense y artista de efectos visuales. Trabajó en Pixar y dirigió Sintel, el corto fantástico de código abierto de Blender Foundation."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Colin Levy é cineasta independente e artista de efeitos visuais dos EUA. Trabalhou na Pixar e dirigiu Sintel, o curta de fantasia de código aberto da Blender Foundation."}}}},
    "美国俄亥俄州": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "美国俄亥俄州"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "美國俄亥俄州"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohio, United States"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohio, États-Unis"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohio, Vereinigte Staaten"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohio, Estados Unidos"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ohio, Estados Unidos"}}}},
    "Halina Reijn 是荷兰知名女演员、导演及作家，多次荣获荷兰电影节金牛奖（Golden Calf）。她曾在保罗·范霍文执导的二战惊悚片《黑皮书》中奉献了精湛演技，并在 Blender 基金会的动画短片《Sintel》中为女主角 Sintel 倾情献声配音。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn 是荷兰知名女演员、导演及作家，多次荣获荷兰电影节金牛奖（Golden Calf）。她曾在保罗·范霍文执导的二战惊悚片《黑皮书》中奉献了精湛演技，并在 Blender 基金会的动画短片《Sintel》中为女主角 Sintel 倾情献声配音。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn 是荷蘭知名女演員、導演及作家，曾多次獲得荷蘭電影節金牛獎。她曾出演保羅·范赫文的《黑皮書》，也為 Blender 基金會短片《Sintel》的女主角配音。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn is a Dutch actress, director, and writer who has won several Golden Calf awards. She starred in Black Book and voiced Sintel in Blender Foundation’s animated short."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn est une actrice, réalisatrice et autrice néerlandaise, plusieurs fois lauréate du Golden Calf. Elle a joué dans Black Book et prêté sa voix à Sintel dans le court métrage de Blender Foundation."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn ist eine niederländische Schauspielerin, Regisseurin und Autorin und mehrfache Golden-Calf-Preisträgerin. Sie spielte in Black Book und sprach Sintel im Animationskurzfilm der Blender Foundation."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn es actriz, directora y escritora neerlandesa, ganadora de varios premios Golden Calf. Actuó en Black Book y puso voz a Sintel en el corto animado de Blender Foundation."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Halina Reijn é atriz, diretora e escritora neerlandesa, vencedora de vários prêmios Golden Calf. Atuou em Black Book e dublou Sintel no curta de animação da Blender Foundation."}}}},
    "荷兰阿姆斯特丹": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷兰阿姆斯特丹"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷蘭阿姆斯特丹"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Amsterdam, Netherlands"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Amsterdam, Pays-Bas"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Amsterdam, Niederlande"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ámsterdam, Países Bajos"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Amsterdã, Países Baixos"}}}},
    "Sacha Goedegebure（网名 Saschart）是知名的 3D 动画艺术家与数字插画师，作为核心导演执导了开源 3D 动画电影《大白兔》（Big Buck Bunny），在开源艺术与计算机图形学领域享有盛誉。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure（网名 Saschart）是知名的 3D 动画艺术家与数字插画师，作为核心导演执导了开源 3D 动画电影《大白兔》（Big Buck Bunny），在开源艺术与计算机图形学领域享有盛誉。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure（網名 Saschart）是知名 3D 動畫藝術家與數位插畫師，曾執導開源 3D 動畫電影《大白兔》（Big Buck Bunny）。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure, also known as Saschart, is a 3D animator and illustrator who co-directed the open movie Big Buck Bunny."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure, alias Saschart, est un artiste 3D et illustrateur qui a coréalisé le film libre Big Buck Bunny."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure, auch Saschart genannt, ist 3D-Animator und Illustrator und führte beim Open Movie Big Buck Bunny mit Regie."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure, conocido como Saschart, es animador 3D e ilustrador y codirigió la película abierta Big Buck Bunny."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sacha Goedegebure, também conhecido como Saschart, é animador 3D e ilustrador e codirigiu o filme aberto Big Buck Bunny."}}}},
    "荷兰": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷兰"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷蘭"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Netherlands"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pays-Bas"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Niederlande"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Países Bajos"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Países Baixos"}}}},
    "Ton Roosendaal 是荷兰著名软件开发者与电影制片人，Blender 开源 3D 创作套件的首席创作者，Blender 基金会创始人兼主席。他主导了《Elephants Dream》、《大白兔》、《Sintel》等一系列开源电影项目，推动了全球开放电影与开源 CG 技术的蓬勃发展。": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal 是荷兰著名软件开发者与电影制片人，Blender 开源 3D 创作套件的首席创作者，Blender 基金会创始人兼主席。他主导了《Elephants Dream》、《大白兔》、《Sintel》等一系列开源电影项目，推动了全球开放电影与开源 CG 技术的蓬勃发展。"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal 是荷蘭知名軟體開發者與電影製片人，也是 Blender 的主要創作者及 Blender 基金會創辦人兼主席。他推動了多部開源電影製作。"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal is a Dutch software developer and film producer, creator of Blender and founder and chair of the Blender Foundation. He led several open movie projects."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal est un développeur et producteur néerlandais, créateur de Blender et fondateur-président de la Blender Foundation. Il a dirigé plusieurs projets de films libres."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal ist ein niederländischer Entwickler und Filmproduzent, Schöpfer von Blender sowie Gründer und Vorsitzender der Blender Foundation. Er leitete mehrere Open-Movie-Projekte."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal es desarrollador y productor neerlandés, creador de Blender y fundador y presidente de Blender Foundation. Lideró varios proyectos de películas abiertas."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ton Roosendaal é desenvolvedor e produtor neerlandês, criador do Blender e fundador e presidente da Blender Foundation. Liderou vários projetos de filmes abertos."}}}},
    "荷兰海尔德兰省": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷兰海尔德兰省"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "荷蘭海爾德蘭省"}}, "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gelderland, Netherlands"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gueldre, Pays-Bas"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Gelderland, Niederlande"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Güeldres, Países Bajos"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Güeldria, Países Baixos"}}}},
    "Apple 官方 16:9 HLS 测试流 (高清晰·自适应)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple 官方 16:9 HLS 测试流（高清·自适应）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple 官方 16:9 HLS 測試串流（高畫質·自適應）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple Official 16:9 HLS Test Stream (HD Adaptive)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Flux de test HLS 16:9 officiel d’Apple (HD adaptatif)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Offizieller Apple-16:9-HLS-Teststream (HD adaptiv)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Flujo de prueba HLS 16:9 oficial de Apple (HD adaptable)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stream de teste HLS 16:9 oficial da Apple (HD adaptativo)"}}}},
    "Apple 官方 HTTP Live Streaming (HLS) 权威测试视频流，包含自适应多码率分片、立体声音频与内嵌字幕，用于验证现代媒体播放器的流式缓冲与分辨率自适应平滑切换。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple 官方 HLS 测试流，含自适应码率、立体声音频和内嵌字幕，可用于测试播放器缓冲与清晰度切换。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apple 官方 HLS 測試串流，包含自適應位元率、立體聲音訊和內嵌字幕，可用於測試播放器緩衝與畫質切換。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Official Apple HLS test stream with adaptive bitrates, stereo audio, and embedded subtitles for testing playback and quality switching."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Flux HLS de test officiel d’Apple avec débits adaptatifs, audio stéréo et sous-titres intégrés, pour tester la lecture et le changement de qualité."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Offizieller Apple-HLS-Teststream mit adaptiven Bitraten, Stereo und eingebetteten Untertiteln zum Testen von Wiedergabe und Qualitätswechsel."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Flujo HLS de prueba oficial de Apple con tasas adaptables, audio estéreo y subtítulos integrados para probar la reproducción y el cambio de calidad."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stream HLS de teste oficial da Apple com taxas adaptativas, áudio estéreo e legendas incorporadas para testar reprodução e mudança de qualidade."}}}},
