    "MDN Flower WebM 测试片段 (MPV 验证)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MDN 花朵 WebM 测试片段（MPV 验证）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MDN 花朵 WebM 測試片段（MPV 驗證）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MDN Flower WebM Test Clip (MPV)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Extrait WebM Flower de MDN (test MPV)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MDN-Flower-WebM-Testclip (MPV)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clip de prueba WebM Flower de MDN (MPV)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clipe de teste WebM Flower da MDN (MPV)"}}}},
    "Mozilla 开发者网络 (MDN) 官方标准 WebM 视频片段，用于验证 MPV 硬件加速、VP8/VP9 软硬解切换与色彩空间映射。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mozilla MDN 官方 WebM 片段，用于测试 MPV 硬件加速、VP8/VP9 解码切换和色彩映射。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mozilla MDN 官方 WebM 片段，用於測試 MPV 硬體加速、VP8/VP9 解碼切換和色彩映射。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Official Mozilla MDN WebM clip for testing MPV hardware acceleration, VP8/VP9 decoding, and color mapping."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Extrait WebM officiel de MDN pour tester l’accélération matérielle de MPV, le décodage VP8/VP9 et le rendu des couleurs."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Offizieller MDN-WebM-Clip zum Testen der MPV-Hardwarebeschleunigung, VP8/VP9-Decodierung und Farbdarstellung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clip WebM oficial de MDN para probar la aceleración de MPV, la decodificación VP8/VP9 y el color."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clipe WebM oficial da MDN para testar a aceleração do MPV, a decodificação VP8/VP9 e as cores."}}}},
