    "大雄兔 Big Buck Bunny (W3C 标准 MP4 直链)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大雄兔 Big Buck Bunny（W3C 标准 MP4 直链）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大雄兔 Big Buck Bunny（W3C 標準 MP4 直連）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Big Buck Bunny (W3C MP4 Stream)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Big Buck Bunny (flux MP4 W3C)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Big Buck Bunny (W3C-MP4-Stream)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Big Buck Bunny (flujo MP4 W3C)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Big Buck Bunny (stream MP4 W3C)"}}}},
    "Blender 基金会制作的著名开源 3D 动画短片。一只体型庞大却性情温柔祥和的大白兔，面对三只调皮捣蛋的森林恶霸小动物，决心用智慧和陷阱展开一场滑稽且精彩的森林大反击。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Blender 基金会的开源 3D 动画短片：温和的大白兔遭遇三只调皮的小动物，决定用巧思展开一场欢乐反击。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Blender 基金會的開源 3D 動畫短片：溫和的大白兔遇上三隻調皮的小動物，決定以巧思展開一場歡樂反擊。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An open-source Blender 3D short: a gentle giant bunny faces three mischievous forest animals and plans a comical comeback."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Court métrage 3D libre de Blender : un grand lapin paisible affronte trois petits animaux malicieux dans une riposte pleine d’humour."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Freier 3D-Kurzfilm von Blender: Ein gutmütiger Hase trifft auf drei freche Waldtiere und plant eine humorvolle Gegenwehr."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Corto 3D abierto de Blender: un conejo bonachón se enfrenta a tres traviesos animales del bosque en una divertida revancha."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Curta 3D aberto da Blender: um coelho gentil enfrenta três animais travessos da floresta em uma revanche divertida."}}}},
