    "Sintel 动画电影预告片 (W3C 标准 MP4 直链)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sintel 动画预告片（W3C 标准 MP4 直链）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sintel 動畫預告片（W3C 標準 MP4 直連）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sintel Animated Trailer (W3C MP4)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bande-annonce animée de Sintel (MP4 W3C)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sintel-Animations-Trailer (W3C MP4)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tráiler animado de Sintel (MP4 W3C)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trailer animado de Sintel (MP4 W3C)"}}}},
    "Blender 基金会打造的开源奇幻史诗动画短片。孤傲坚强的女孩 Sintel 在荒野风雪中救起了一只受重伤的小飞龙并悉心照料。当小龙被成年巨龙掠走后，她义无反顾地踏上孤独而艰险的漫漫寻友征途。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Blender 基金会的开源奇幻短片。Sintel 在荒野中救下一只小龙；小龙被巨龙带走后，她踏上寻友旅程。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Blender 基金會的開源奇幻短片。Sintel 在荒野中救起一隻小龍；小龍被巨龍帶走後，她踏上尋友旅程。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An open fantasy short from Blender Foundation. Sintel rescues a dragon hatchling, then sets out to find it after it is taken away."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Court métrage fantastique libre de la Blender Foundation : Sintel sauve un dragonneau, puis part à sa recherche lorsqu’il est enlevé."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Freier Fantasy-Kurzfilm der Blender Foundation: Sintel rettet ein Drachenjunges und macht sich auf die Suche, als es entführt wird."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Corto fantástico abierto de Blender Foundation: Sintel salva a una cría de dragón y sale a buscarla cuando se la llevan."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Curta de fantasia aberto da Blender Foundation: Sintel salva um filhote de dragão e parte em busca dele quando é levado."}}}},
