    "高清 MP4 测试短片 1 (国内高速 CDN 直链)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高清 MP4 测试短片 1（高速 CDN）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高清 MP4 測試短片 1（高速 CDN）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HD MP4 Test Clip 1 (Fast CDN)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Extrait MP4 HD 1 (CDN rapide)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HD-MP4-Testclip 1 (schnelles CDN)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clip de prueba MP4 HD 1 (CDN rápido)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clipe de teste MP4 HD 1 (CDN rápido)"}}}},
    "国内主流高速云 CDN 节点加速的 MP4 H.264 基准测试视频，极速加载，适合测试国内弱网以及低延迟流媒体加载。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由高速 CDN 提供的 MP4 H.264 测试视频，适合测试加载速度、弱网与低延迟播放。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由高速 CDN 提供的 MP4 H.264 測試影片，適合測試載入速度、弱網與低延遲播放。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MP4 H.264 test video delivered by a fast CDN, useful for testing loading, weak networks, and low-latency playback."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vidéo de test MP4 H.264 via CDN rapide, utile pour tester le chargement, les réseaux faibles et la faible latence."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MP4-H.264-Testvideo über ein schnelles CDN zum Testen von Ladezeit, schwachen Netzen und niedriger Latenz."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vídeo de prueba MP4 H.264 desde una CDN rápida para probar carga, redes débiles y baja latencia."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vídeo de teste MP4 H.264 via CDN rápida para testar carregamento, redes instáveis e baixa latência."}}}},
