    "高清 MP4 测试短片 2 (国内高速 CDN 直链)": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高清 MP4 测试短片 2（高速 CDN）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高清 MP4 測試短片 2（高速 CDN）"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HD MP4 Test Clip 2 (Fast CDN)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Extrait MP4 HD 2 (CDN rapide)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HD-MP4-Testclip 2 (schnelles CDN)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clip de prueba MP4 HD 2 (CDN rápido)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clipe de teste MP4 HD 2 (CDN rápido)"}}}},
    "国内主流云端分发的多媒体测试素材，包含生动的高对比度动态场景，适合用于验证屏幕色彩与渲染帧率表现。": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用于测试显示效果的多媒体片段，包含高对比度动态画面，可检验色彩与帧率表现。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用於測試顯示效果的多媒體片段，包含高對比度動態畫面，可檢驗色彩與影格率表現。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A high-contrast video sample for checking display color and rendering frame rate."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Extrait vidéo à fort contraste pour vérifier les couleurs et la fréquence d’images."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrastreiches Videobeispiel zum Prüfen von Farben und Bildrate."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Muestra de alto contraste para comprobar el color y la frecuencia de imagen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Amostra de alto contraste para conferir cores e taxa de quadros."}}}},
    "色彩基准": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"色彩基准"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"色彩基準"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Color Benchmark"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Référence couleur"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Farbbenchmark"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referencia de color"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Referência de cor"}}}}
